stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Running: CLI command starts
    Running --> TerminalGone: Terminal hangs up (EIO / POLLHUP / POLLERR / POLLNVAL)
    Running --> OpenError: Open-terminal or file I/O error
    Running --> FinishedOk: Command completes normally (exit 0)

    TerminalGone --> Propagated: Boundary maps via ui_terminal.terminalGone -> TerminalHungUp
    Propagated --> QuietExit129: Subcommand catches rethrow TerminalHungUp -> commandFailure exits 129 (stderr empty)

    OpenError --> ReportedExit1: Error preserved -> commandFailure reports message and exits 1
    QuietExit129 --> [*]
    ReportedExit1 --> [*]
    FinishedOk --> [*]
